# Admin / ops SPAs

- Follow existing AppShell, auth store, and `lib/api` patterns in each app.
- Brand: charcoal `#0F0F1A`, amber `#D4A017`. Prefer existing Tailwind tokens over new palette.
- Do not invent API shapes—align with NestJS controllers.
- Portal POS and payments UIs must respect tenant payment credential model.
